                                                "sense_id": "3903d1ad-9501-3396-a489-708c9ad7b272",
                                                "text": "In contrast, all the interactions in this motif are conserved in several distantly related genomes such as the beta-proteobacterium B. pertussis and the firmicute D. hafniense (fig. 2b)."
